flowchart TD
    Start[Agent proposes a state-changing action] --> ValidateProposal[Validate action type and input schema]
    ValidateProposal --> ProposalValid{Proposal valid?}
    ProposalValid -->|No| RejectProposal[Reject proposal; no state change]
    ProposalValid -->|Yes| Authz[Banking backend derives customer identity from trusted session]
    Authz --> Checks[Check session, customer ownership, permissions and required verification]
    Checks --> Authorized{Authorized and verified?}
    Authorized -->|No| Deny[Reject action safely; audit denial]
    Authorized -->|Yes| Summarize[Build a human-readable summary of the exact proposed action]
    Summarize --> Persist[Persist pending action with customer/session binding, action details, creation time, expiry and status]
    Persist --> AuditPending[Audit confirmation requested]
    AuditPending --> Ask[Return confirmation_id and show action summary; ask for explicit confirmation]
    Ask --> Wait[Return awaiting_confirmation; do not execute action]

    Wait --> Followup[Customer sends a later message]
    Followup --> Resolve[Resolve pending action using confirmation_id when supplied, otherwise trusted session context]
    Resolve --> Match{Explicit confirmation identifies and matches one pending action?}
    Match -->|No / ambiguous / decline| NoExecute[Do not execute; clarify or cancel pending action]
    NoExecute --> RecordNo[Record decline, ambiguity or cancellation]
    RecordNo --> EndNo[Return outcome to customer]

    Match -->|Yes| StateCheck[Load pending action and current security state]
    StateCheck --> Valid{Pending, unexpired, unused and correctly bound?}
    Valid -->|No| Expired[Reject confirmation; explain that a new request may be needed]
    Expired --> AuditInvalid[Audit invalid, expired or replayed confirmation]
    AuditInvalid --> EndInvalid[Return safe outcome]

    Valid --> Reauthorize[Recheck customer identity, ownership, permissions and verification]
    Reauthorize --> StillAllowed{Still authorized and valid?}
    StillAllowed -->|No| Deny
    StillAllowed -->|Yes| Consume[Atomically mark confirmation as consumed / execution-in-progress]
    Consume --> Idempotency[Use stable idempotency key for this pending action]
    Idempotency --> Execute[Execute operation through the Banking API]
    Execute --> Outcome{Definitive result received?}
    Outcome -->|Success| Success[Persist successful result]
    Outcome -->|Definitive failure| Failure[Persist failed result and safe error]
    Outcome -->|Timeout / unknown| Unknown[Persist outcome as unknown; do not blindly retry]
    Success --> AuditResult[Write audit record with action ID, actor, tool, outcome and correlation ID]
    Failure --> AuditResult
    Unknown --> Reconcile[Query operation status or reconcile with source of truth]
    Reconcile --> Reconciled{Outcome resolved?}
    Reconciled -->|Yes| Finalize[Persist reconciled outcome]
    Reconciled -->|No| Escalate[Keep outcome marked unknown; hand off for human review]
    Finalize --> AuditResult
    Escalate --> AuditResult
    AuditResult --> Respond[Return outcome to agent for customer-facing response]
    Respond --> End[Agent explains result without overstating certainty]

    classDef security fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#9a6700,color:#222;
    classDef persistence fill:#d9ead3,stroke:#38761d,color:#222;
    classDef decision fill:#d9eaf7,stroke:#134f5c,color:#222;
    class Authz,Checks,Reauthorize,Consume security;
    class Persist,AuditPending,RecordNo,AuditInvalid,Success,Failure,Unknown,Finalize,AuditResult persistence;
    class ProposalValid,Authorized,Match,Valid,StillAllowed,Outcome,Reconciled decision;
